---
import Slide from '../ui/Slide.astro';
---

<Slide
  id="s24-layer-networking"
  chapter="Layers"
  title="Networking"
  track="core"
  notes="Trace the path: DNS name → Service → EndpointSlice → kube-proxy/CNI → Pod IP → NetworkPolicy. Connection refused vs timeout vs NXDOMAIN each point to different layers."
>
  <div class="stagger flex flex-col gap-6">
    <section>
      <h3 class="mb-3 font-display text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-deck-cyan">Purpose</h3>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-deck-text/90 md:text-xl">
        Pod-to-pod connectivity, cluster DNS, Services, Ingress/Gateway API, CNI dataplane, and NetworkPolicy enforcement.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h3 class="mb-3 font-display text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-deck-rose">Typical failures</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-lg text-deck-text/90 md:text-xl">
        <li>• No Ready addresses — selector mismatch or pods not Ready</li>
        <li>• NXDOMAIN — wrong Service name or namespace</li>
        <li>• Timeout — NetworkPolicy drop or routing black hole</li>
        <li>• 502 at ingress — backend port or name mismatch</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h3 class="mb-3 font-display text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-deck-amber">Observable symptoms</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-lg text-deck-text/90 md:text-xl">
        <li>• Connection refused vs timeout vs NXDOMAIN</li>
        <li>• Empty / not-ready EndpointSlice for a Service</li>
        <li>• Works in-cluster but fails via Ingress</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</Slide>
